--
--   **Context.** Round six, item language (I3): cost bounds of the steps of a node
--
--   `KFWCost2` with the literal `W_c`, `A0`, `mC` replaced by variables: with
--   `P = (W n) · Yu r Z H` (`n` records per role, `W` roles, at most `A` atoms per gate, `m` slots):
--
--   * `cost_gateH`, `cost_permH`, `cost_phaseH`, `cost_fixGH`, `cost_rowH`: every local step costs
